1
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:54,000
Love doesn't always arrive on schedule.

2
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:42,000
Lucky 7 is a romance, comedy, tv movie film directed by Harry Winer.

3
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:30,000
Instead of really living her life since losing her mother at age 7, Seattle lawyer Amy Myer sticks to a
foolproof 'timeline' her mother drew as a guideline to help plot the course of her life.

4
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:18,000
The timeline, which proves to be accurate in all other respects,
predicts that Amy should marry her seventh boyfriend.

5
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
However, Amy must question her instincts when she feels that her sixth
boyfriend is the one she should marry, not the predicted seventh.

6
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:54,000
Now she must decide whether to follow her mother's
advice, or follow her own heart.

7
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:42,000
Amy Myer, played by Kimberly Williams-Paisley.

8
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:30,000
Peter Connor, played by Patrick Dempsey.

9
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:18,000
Daniel McCandless, played by Brad Rowe.

10
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Bernie Myer, played by Brian Markinson.

11
00:52:48,000 --> 00:52:54,000
Ray, played by Lochlyn Munro.

12
00:57:36,000 --> 00:57:42,000
Maya, played by Michelle Harrison.

13
01:02:24,000 --> 01:02:30,000
Lucky 7 is a 2003 American television film starring
Patrick Dempsey and Kimberly Williams.

14
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
The film premiered on ABC Family on July 20, 2003.

15
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
In the film, a female lawyer arranges her life according
to the predictions of her deceased mother.

16
01:16:48,000 --> 01:16:54,000
Her mother predicted that she would marry her 7th boyfriend, but the lawyer is
confused when she concurrently dates two boyfriends following a break-up.

17
01:21:36,000 --> 01:21:42,000
Which one is the 6th boyfriend and which one the
7th boyfriend is unclear to her.

18
01:26:24,000 --> 01:26:30,000
The film explores themes of businessman, fireworks,
seattle, washington, road trip, lawyer.

19
01:31:12,000 --> 01:31:18,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
